====== NETGEAR R7200 v1======

The R7200 (Nighthawk AC2100 Smart WiFi Router) is similar to the R6700 v2 and is sold in Canada by various retailers.
In OpenWrt 21.02.1, the R6700 v2 binary must be used for installation. Starting with Openwrt 22.03, this device has its own binary.
Note that upgrading from 21.02 to 22.03 requires forcing the update, because the old binary was made for device R6700 v2 and the new is only for R7200.

